            description="&lt;p>&lt;strong>Supply of working materials:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>Working materials need to be provided to the working stations in-time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>Currently, it&amp;#39;s the same worker in charge of fetching materials, so production delays are unavoidable&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li>Objective is to reduce the delays due to material fetching&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;">
